Key results:

- Baseline family-A frequency: **0.886200** (95% Wilson CI: 0.883051–0.889275)
- Collapsed family-uniform A frequency: **0.499400** (95% CI: 0.494500–0.504300)
- Grid-cardinality effect: **0.386800**
